WEBVTT

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.620
That was intense, Master.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.620
You ran around the room at least 20 times.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:30.540
Where... the hell... did Claiomh run off to?

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.910
That bastard!

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:39.000
That one was my best dish yet, too...

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.950
My "Filled with Nutrients That'll Heal
You Right Up, One Shot One Kill Stew!"

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.910
I wonder what went wrong.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:49.950
I wonder what went wrong.

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:53.250
Hey. Did you mess up on something, too?

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:57.200
Huh? Well, I suppose do nothing but mess up.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:58.620
Oh, thank goodness!

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:05.080
I was beginning to think I'm the
only one who messes up in this world!

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:08.370
This is what my master would tell me:

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:13.540
But a single failure and
a single success are the same thing.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.790
It's how you handle it later.

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:23.660
I'm thinking about trying hard
to make a failure into a success.

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:28.540
I think Father mentioned that before, too.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:30.200
Huh?

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:08.000
"The Uoar Class"

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:16.540
There's only one thing I want to ask you.

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.750
Where's the Browning Family's Atlas?

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:24.830
I-It's not here. I heard it
was loaned out a few years ago.

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:26.540
To whom?

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:28.540
Ch-Childman...

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:01.250
This is the mansion of one
of the high-ranking Sorcerers

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:03.870
of the Tower of Fangs, Leticia MacCredy.

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:07.290
And you're Krylancelo.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:10.620
Let me just ask one thing.
The Browning Family's...

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:16.910
I call upon thee, Tiny Spirits

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:22.080
And here's Clee's special dinner!

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:27.910
My Invincible Meatloaf!

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:29.910
O-Orphen?

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:37.620
You'll never get better if you don't eat.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:40.750
I'll feel even worse if I eat that.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.830
Master, are you all right?

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:44.830
Yeah, because I haven't eaten it yet.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.000
Not that. I'm talking
about that man from earlier.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:49.410
The one who went after you.

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:51.450
He's a Stabber.

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:52.410
Again?

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:55.120
Apparently, this one was from the tower.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.660
Why do people keep coming after you like that?

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.500
What the heck's going on?

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.830
This has nothing to do with you!

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.250
That's enough!

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:14.540
I had so much work because of you.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:19.500
And I'm finally able
to sleep again after 38 hours!

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:21.410
Right...

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:29.950
You want to go to the tower?

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:33.000
Apparently, Majic wants to enroll officially.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.080
At a time like this?

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:37.700
I took care of the guy killing the elders.

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:40.120
But there wasn't a body left at the scene.

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:43.790
That Krylancelo was a Killing Doll.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:46.370
Killing Doll?

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:49.620
The anti-Sorcerer killing machine.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:52.950
They have Nornir's runes
engraved in their bodies.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:55.830
Once those runes are written,
that would activate the Sorcery,

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:58.830
and it can use Silent Sorcery.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:03.200
Yes... She'd been watching over you.

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:06.200
And then, she activated me and controlled me.

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:13.790
If that's true, who's the one
who found them and activated them?

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:21.540
Azalie!

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:25.660
Why did you kill the elders?

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:27.790
Was it out of spite?

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:29.950
Why did you kill the ranger...

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:32.620
Why did you kidnap Claiomh?

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:36.750
I wasn't expecting that thing
to obtain a will of its own.

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:40.620
To think that it'd do anything other
than what I ordered it to do...

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:46.330
I... don't know.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:49.700
I hate that your lies are so obvious.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.830
It's all right.

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:57.080
Could you just read this for now?

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:03.410
"Krylancelo, age 20. From the Childman Class.

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:06.200
He has been on a secret mission
outside the tower for five years.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:11.250
His guarantor is Leticia MacCredy
from the same class."

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:13.790
That's the latest record from the tower.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:16.290
I updated it myself.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:20.040
You haven't lost your rank
of high-ranking Sorcerer,

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.830
but if you do anything else to upset the tower,

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:27.540
you'll seriously have to fight
one of the tower's Stabbers.

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:30.290
Looks like it's already come to that.

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:31.750
What?

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:37.200
"They were no longer sisters,

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:40.040
and I had a brief conversation with them."

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:46.500
Who gave you permission to read that?!

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:49.620
Hey, wait. This isn't my diary.

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:51.750
Ow...

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:54.660
My bad. They looked pretty similar.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.700
What's that book in your right hand?

00:07:56.700 --> 00:07:58.370
Oh. You're right.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:02.040
You actually keep a diary?

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:06.000
Well, I've been experiencing
new things ever since I left home!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.830
I thought I'd write everything down,
so I don't forget.

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:10.160
What are you writing about?

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:14.290
Like, "I had the Tower of Fangs
gelato today, and it was yummy!"

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:17.700
Or, "Tafrem pudding was the best!"

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:21.580
So what the heck is that beat-up book?

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:26.330
I'm not really sure myself since
I've only been able to read bits and pieces.

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:31.790
Something about the order of
the world will be destroyed or changed...

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:35.000
We're going out for a bit, Majic.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.080
Where are you going?

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:37.160
To the school of sorcery.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:38.620
I'll go, too!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.660
You're not going.

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:42.950
What?! Why are you leaving me out?

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:46.370
I want to look around the symbol of Tafrem!

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:49.120
The school isn't a tourist spot!

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:53.540
If you want to go sightseeing,
I'll have my students show you around.

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:56.080
Why not go see the sights
and enjoy some specialties?

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:58.790
Yeah! Totally!

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:06.000
Being able to eat Tower of Fangs gelato
while admiring the Tower of Fangs is the best!

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:09.290
It's so obvious that you're not
from around here that it's embarrassing.

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:13.910
Let me try out some Tower of Fangs sweet buns
and Tower of Fangs custard bread, too!

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:16.410
We've got just the thing for you!

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:19.160
Here's the tower's famous mascot, Mr. Tower!

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:22.330
Can't really recommend him
as a cushion since he's so pointy...

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:25.660
But you'll be able to sleep soundly
if you use him as a hug pillow!

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:28.370
Hey, you're the dwarves from the other day!

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:30.620
What the heck are you doing here?

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:31.700
Yikes!

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:33.500
What the heck are you doing here?

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.120
You're in the way of business! Get lost!

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:38.950
Don't make me tell Orphen on you two!

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:42.750
Crap. You're in cahoots
with that money-lending Sorcerer.

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:44.500
Dortin, let's scram!

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:45.000
Right!

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:49.040
Let's find a place we
can sell a bunch of Mr. Towers!

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:51.250
Mr. Tower is such a strange name.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:54.330
This tower was originally
called the Atlas Tower.

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:56.500
The Atlas Tower?

00:09:56.500 --> 00:10:02.410
The person who created the tower was
the priest to the Celestial Beings, Istersiva.

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:08.000
And she apparently said, "If you have
doubts in this world, look no further."

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.080
So did someone look?

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.450
Forty years ago,

00:10:11.450 --> 00:10:15.910
the upper echelon of the Tower
of Fangs tried to investigate this place

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:20.290
and went to war with the Kimluck Church,
which guarded the area.

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:24.450
Ever since then, the entrance has been sealed.

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:26.750
The upper echelon of the tower?

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:30.000
They're the one who
give the orders at the tower.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:30.870
"Tower of Fangs"  "Upper Echelon (15)"
 "Other Classes | Childman Class | Uoar Curlaine Class"
"Students    |    Students    |    Students"

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:32.910
"Tower of Fangs"  "Upper Echelon (15)"
 "Other Classes | Childman Class | Uoar Curlaine Class"
"Students    |    Students    |    Students"

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:32.910
Below them, are the various classes,

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:35.080
"Tower of Fangs"  "Upper Echelon (15)"
 "Other Classes | Childman Class | Uoar Curlaine Class"
"Students    |    Students    |    Students"

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:35.080
and they carry out the orders.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:36.870
"Tower of Fangs"  "Upper Echelon (15)"
 "Other Classes | Childman Class | Uoar Curlaine Class"
"Students    |    Students    |    Students"

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:36.870
Does that include the Childman Class?

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.660
"Tower of Fangs"  "Upper Echelon (15)"
 "Other Classes | Childman Class | Uoar Curlaine Class"
"Students    |    Students    |    Students"

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.660
Yes.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:43.950
The Childman Class gained
more authority than the other classes

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:47.200
and have influence over
the upper echelon as well.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:51.450
The upper echelon favors
the Childman Class quite a bit,

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:55.750
so the other classes hold
resentment towards them.

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:57.870
But...

00:10:57.870 --> 00:11:00.950
Now that Master Childman has disappeared,

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:04.330
order at the tower has become threatened.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.910
Just because one of the teachers went missing?

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:10.200
It should give you an idea
about how much his influence

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:13.790
was keeping anyone
that was overambitious at bay.

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:27.250
He doesn't have to enroll at a time
like this when Master isn't around.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:31.950
It's because we're in times like this
I want to learn more Sorcery.

00:11:31.950 --> 00:11:35.540
At this rate, I'm just going
to keep getting in Master's way.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:36.830
I'm useless.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:41.500
Well, if you're that determined,
Forte might actually agree

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:44.080
to letting you enroll in the Childman Class.

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:48.410
Tish.

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:49.620
What?

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:53.080
You remember anyone
having a grudge against you?

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:54.500
Don't compare me to you.

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:57.250
I live a respectable life.

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:03.330
So if anyone tries to ambush us...

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:08.120
...it's probably my fault.

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:09.660
I'd assume so.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.120
--Wait.
--Ambush?

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:20.200
I knit thee thus, Chainmail of Haloes!

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:30.200
Cover your nose and mouth!

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:34.200
Flow thus! Angel Breath!

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:50.080
We're surrounded.

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:03.910
We're surrounded.

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:10.000
Must be followers of the Dragon Faiths.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:13.040
How many can you take
on at once without Sorcery?

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:16.290
I'd say two at most if I'm unarmed.

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:17.700
Are there any weapons?

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:20.200
There are some swords
in the coach's box just in case.

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:21.660
You use one of those, Tish.

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:23.370
I'm gonna jump out there, so cover me.

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:24.830
What about me, Master?

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:26.450
You, stay put.

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:36.540
What is this?

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:39.620
My awareness... My senses...

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:42.750
...are extremely sharp right now.

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:52.790
Wow...

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:55.540
Guess you didn't need that backup.

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:58.500
I wish you hadn't looked so grim

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:01.200
if you knew that you could
take on this many yourself.

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:10.200
Your internal organs are
probably damaged from the blows.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:14.200
You probably shouldn't move
or breathe in too deeply.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:16.500
Shut up, Sorcerer!

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.620
Why did you attack us?

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:20.540
We're avenging our comrades!

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.370
Avenging your comrades?

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:25.250
I don't remember giving
you guys a reason to hate me...

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:31.370
Maybe I do.

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:35.040
Your existence alone is unforgivable!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:37.870
You slaughtered our comrades!

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:39.200
Slaughtered?

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:42.290
Yeah, I definitely didn't do that.

00:14:42.290 --> 00:14:45.410
Demon Sword of Puanook!

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:59.080
H-His neck!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.330
Who's there?!

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:07.000
You're...

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:09.120
Krylancelo.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:12.620
I'm sure neither of us wanted
to see each other again,

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:14.660
but I came to escort you.

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:17.540
Why don't we reminisce about the old times?

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:24.450
The name's Hydrant. I'm sure you remember me.

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:26.910
Of course, I do.

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:28.830
But why did you do that?

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:33.830
I'm not like you. I can actually kill people.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:39.000
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:54.660
You don't need to get so angry
that you can't control your own Sorcery.

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:57.700
But that was quite the impact.

00:15:57.700 --> 00:16:01.000
That might've almost killed me.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.200
Just like back then.

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:13.120
Thankfully, half of my face survived,
so I'd like it to stay that way.

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:14.450
Wouldn't you agree, Tish?

00:16:14.450 --> 00:16:18.120
We're getting escorted by Hydrant
from the upper echelon himself?

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.830
Maybe I'm more popular than I thought.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:23.080
But of course.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:26.500
The tower welcomes you.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:47.830
I am Master Forte's secretary, Vinbi.

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:49.330
Lady Leticia,

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:54.870
he would like you to assist this
young man with his enrollment papers.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:56.790
Please, come in.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:11.830
So the man you just met... is a spy.

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:14.290
You mean your secretary.

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:15.830
Correct.

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:17.870
Well, that was out of nowhere, as usual.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:21.500
That's the first thing you say to
someone you haven't seen in five years?

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:24.200
Should I ask you something else?

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:27.250
Did you kill the elders? Or...

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:31.370
Do you know where Master Childman is?

00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:36.540
There's no point in asking you questions
that I know you won't answer.

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:38.580
Back to the subject of the secretary...

00:17:38.580 --> 00:17:41.370
His name is Vinbi Stotall.

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:43.660
I'm sure it's not his real name.

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:47.830
I hired him because he said
he wasn't registered at the tower...

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:50.080
...but I did a little digging and found out that

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:54.290
he belonged to some class and was
thrown out seven years ago for bad behavior.

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:59.370
He then encountered Uoar Curlaine.

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:01.750
Uoar set his eyes on him.

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:04.370
He's probably a powerful Sorcerer.

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:07.910
I'm sure he's at least
had assassination training.

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:12.790
Tish had mentioned that
someone poisoned your teacup.

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:15.660
So why are you so calm?

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:20.700
Well, the Uoar Class is
the tower's only assassination class.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.540
You were in that class until you were ten.

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:24.950
That's why I know what I'm talking about!

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:29.830
Whatever you do in this tower, you can't
have the Uoar Class set their eyes on you!

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.290
You know that yourself!

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:36.410
And that's why we also have to crush them first.

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:43.080
I suppose you ran into Hydrant.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:48.620
Before he ended up in the upper echelon,
he was in the Uoar Class.

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:55.580
Last night, someone that I'm pretty sure is a
Stabber from the tower infiltrated Tish's home.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:59.040
I'm sure that the Uoar Class is involved.

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:05.000
So they're making their move.
They're trying to destroy the Childman Class.

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:07.450
About yesterday...

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:13.160
Followers of the Dragon Faiths were
slaughtered on the outskirts of Tafrem.

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:14.790
Slaughtered?

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:18.370
Your existence alone is unforgivable!

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:21.580
You slaughtered our comrades!

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:22.950
Don't tell me that's also...

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:24.200
To tell you the truth,

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:26.620
the reason I didn't have Tish come in as well,

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:31.200
is because I thought you
should be the only one to see this.

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:35.200
Here's the report about the attack.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:41.620
"High-ranking Sorcerer
Leticia MacCredy and her party

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:43.950
were attacked by followers of the Dragon Faith,

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:48.290
but after an intense battle,
the attackers all died."

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.790
"The attackers all died"?!

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:54.080
"I testify that the actions
taken were in self-defense.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:55.700
Milan Toram."

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:59.830
Milan Toram. That's Hydrant's true name.

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:03.040
It's all too convenient.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:06.200
This must've been planned beforehand.

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:12.200
I'm sure if Tish saw that report,
she'd immediately barge into their class--

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:18.120
Apparently, you'd do the same thing.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:32.040
When did you--

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.250
I just happened to be in your blind spot.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:36.500
Master Uoar Curlaine.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:40.540
Ah, so you remembered me, Krylancelo.

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:42.450
I'm looking for Hydrant.

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:44.700
You mean Milan?

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:47.450
He is no longer a student of this class.

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:51.290
That doesn't matter!
I know you know what he did!

00:20:51.290 --> 00:20:53.950
We didn't kill anyone!

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:57.950
That bastard Hydrant... After we left,

00:20:57.950 --> 00:21:02.910
he finished off all those
followers of the Dragon Faith...

00:21:03.450 --> 00:21:09.040
I don't know if you or Milan finished them off.

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:13.040
But my class recovered the bodies.

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:16.200
In the end, we were just sent
in to clean up the mess.

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:19.330
So you're just going to turn a blind eye.

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:22.080
Just remember this.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:25.540
Just try and lay a finger on
Tish or the boy I brought with me.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:29.620
I'll show you how it feels
to be targeted by a Stabber.

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:32.000
Don't forget who I am!

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:35.330
Of course, I haven't forgotten, Krylancelo.

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:40.450
You are the best student
that Childman had ever raised.

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:45.370
Hydrant was no match
for you in the past, after all.

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:48.370
I clearly remember thinking at that moment

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:53.080
that I should've never let Childman have you.

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:57.830
But I also recommend that
you don't make me your enemy.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:02.660
Childman currently isn't
at the tower right now, after all.

00:23:37.790 --> 00:23:42.950
But man, you sure do get one guy after another
coming for your life, Money-lending Sorcerer.

00:23:42.950 --> 00:23:45.040
And you brothers sure
keep showing up wherever I go!

00:23:45.040 --> 00:23:47.040
"Death Keening"

00:23:45.040 --> 00:23:47.040
And you brothers sure
keep showing up wherever I go!
